OCHAR3,	TAD OUTEMP		/THIRD CHARACTER
	CLL RTL			/HIGH ORDER BITS GO INTO THE
	RTL			/HIGH ORDER 4 BITS OF THE
	AND (7400		/FIRST OF TWO WORDS
	TAD I OUPOLD
	DCA I OUPOLD
