	SMA CLA			/ERROR. IF AC<0, IT WAS FATAL.
	JMP OK			/NON FILE-STRUCTURED OUTPUT
	JMS TERR
	TEXT /OPEN FAILED/
OK,	JMS I (ICHAR		/READ A CHARACTER
	JMP TSTEOF		/ERROR, SEE IF EOF
	SNA			/IGNORE BLANKS
	JMP OK
	JMS I (OCHAR		/AND OUTPUT THE CHARACTER
	JMP OUTERR
	JMP OK			/CONTINUE TILL EOF
TSTEOF,	SMA CLA			/WAS IT FATAL?
